    <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[The landscape of Business Process Outsourcing (BPO) is in a constant state of evolution. As we look towards 2025 and beyond, the next decade promises even more transformative changes, driven by technology, shifting customer expectations, and new business models. Centro is at forefront of this evolution, committed to helping businesses navigate these future trends and harness the power of next-gene]]></Value>
